"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}I did warn you… Multiple times, actually."
},
{
"k": "33697",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[tense]{SarcasticA}I just needed a few more days, then everything would've been sorted."
},
{
"k": "33698",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "If Snow had just given me the money I was due, I wouldn't be in this mess!"
},
{
"k": "33699",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[bitter]{AnnoyedA}Fine job she's doin'."
},
{
"k": "33700",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[bitter]{SarcasticA}At least you're on my side... fat lot of good that did though."
},
{
"k": "33701",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "She's no better than Crane at this point."
},
{
"k": "33702",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "You two are just blowin' this whole thing out of proportion."
},
{
"k": "33703",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}Look, Snow's in charge now. This is what she wanted."
},
{
"k": "33704",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}Just... calm down, okay? This is the way it has to be."
},
{
"k": "33705",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{AnnoyedA}I will not calm down."
},
{
"k": "33706",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[bitter]Yeah, fine. But is it my fault if I can't afford a glamour? I'm tryin', Bigby. You know that."
},
{
"k": "33707",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "Well she can go fuck herself!"
},
{
"k": "33708",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "And now Miss White's breathin' down me neck."
},
{
"k": "33709",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "She's just as bad as Crane was. He promised to pay me to help fix up the building, but did I ever see any of that? No."
},
{
"k": "33710",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "Says she's not in the business of givin' out handouts."
},
{
"k": "33711",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "Complaining won't help."
},
{
"k": "33712",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[warning]Toad, that's enough! What did I say about bad-mouthing Snow?"
},
{
"k": "33713",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "Who are you, her fuckin' handler?"
},
{
"k": "33714",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "This is bullshit, Bigby."
},
{
"k": "33715",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "But she doesn't give a toss."
},
{
"k": "33716",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "She could help if she wanted to."
},
{
"k": "33717",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "I'll talk to her."
},
{
"k": "33718",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "Look, I'll... I'll talk to her. Okay?"
},
{
"k": "33719",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "That's what you said before!"
},
{
"k": "33720",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "Sure you will."
},
{
"k": "33721",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "Snow wasn't lying, Toad. Fabletown... doesn't have a lot of money at the moment. We can't afford to be giving it away."
},
{
"k": "33722",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "We're struggling to make things work as it is."
},
{
"k": "33723",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "Well maybe if she was doin' a better job of runnin' the place then the town wouldn't be broke off it's arse."
},
{
"k": "33724",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{AnnoyedA}I honestly don't know why Mayor Cole confirmed 'er in the first place. She basically forced her way in."
},
{
"k": "33725",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "I want someone who knows what it's like. Someone who'll look out for the rest of us. You know what I mean."
},
{
"k": "33726",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "What makes her fit to be Deputy Mayor?"
},
{
"k": "33727",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "She earned it."
},
{
"k": "33728",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "She's not ready."
},
{
"k": "33729",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "She'll do fine."
},
{
"k": "33730",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "Don't know why I bother talkin' to you anyway."
},
{
"k": "33731",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "Snow earned this position, Toad. I have faith in her ability to run this town."
},
{
"k": "33732",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "Oh, I see. Still got you in her back pocket, huh?"
},
{
"k": "33733",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "I don't think she's ready for this position either, but that's just the way things are."
},
{
"k": "33734",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "We just have to... move on."
},
{
"k": "33735",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "Easy for you to say... you get to keep your apartment."
},
{
"k": "33736",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "Snow will do just fine as Deputy Mayor. I'm not worried."
},
{
"k": "33737",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[sarcastic]Oh, well as long as you're not worried."
},
{
"k": "33738",
"who": "FLYCATCHER",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[pleading]{FrustratedA}Come on, Colin."
},
{
"k": "33739",
"who": "KIDTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}I have something..."
},
{
"k": "33740",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[annoyed]{AnnoyedA}I'm walkin', all right! Calm down."
},
{
"k": "33741",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[quietly]Didn't want to leave the city."
},
{
"k": "33742",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[quietly]{NormalA}You know he was up cryin' all night. Poor kid."
},
{
"k": "33743",
"who": "KIDTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}Wait! Sheriff Bigby!"
},
{
"k": "33744",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "It won't be so bad."
},
{
"k": "33745",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "That's really not my problem."
},
{
"k": "33746",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[muttering]Bastard."
},
{
"k": "33747",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "It won't be so bad up there. You never know… you two might like it at the Farm."
},
{
"k": "33748",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[bitter]Oh, you're sorry. Good. That's just great."
},
{
"k": "33749",
"who": "KIDTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}Dad says there's no time to say goodbye, so..."
},
{
"k": "33750",
"who": "KIDTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}Can you give this to Miss White? [beat] Please."
},
{
"k": "33751",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "I'm busy."
},
{
"k": "33752",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}What is it?"
},
{
"k": "33753",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}Yeah... sure."
},
{
"k": "33754",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}Look, I'm kind of busy here..."
},
{
"k": "33755",
"who": "KIDTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}It's a Willow Beetle."
},
{
"k": "33756",
"who": "KIDTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}I couldn't take them all with me. And she said she liked that one the best."
},
{
"k": "33757",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "That's nice."
},
{
"k": "33758",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "That's a weird gift..."
},
{
"k": "33759",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "She'll love it."
},
{
"k": "33760",
"who": "KIDTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[But...]{NormalA}She said it was pretty. [beat; more sure] She'll like it."
},
{
"k": "33761",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[ALT][flat]{NormalA}That's gross, TJ."
},
{
"k": "33762",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{DoubtfulA}That's... real nice."
},
{
"k": "33763",
"who": "KIDTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}She said it was pretty."
},
{
"k": "33764",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{HappyA}I'm sure she'll love it."
},
{
"k": "33765",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[to himself]{NormalA}God, I hope not."
},
{
"k": "33766",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "I guess it's time to go then."
},
{
"k": "33767",
"who": "KIDTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[near tears]{SadA}Do we have to go?"
},
{
"k": "33768",
"who": "KIDTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}What's it like at the Farm?"
},
{
"k": "33769",
"who": "KIDTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{FearA}I've heard ogres live there. And they eat people in their sleep sometimes."
},
{
"k": "33770",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}Well, we don't have a choice anymore."
},
{
"k": "33771",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}Don't worry. You'll be a lot safer there."
},
{
"k": "33772",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{DoubtfulA}I'm sorry, TJ."
},
{
"k": "33773",
"who": "KIDTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[sniffles] {SadA}Okay..."
},
{
"k": "33774",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}Your dad broke the rules, TJ. You're not allowed to stay in Fabletown without a glamour."
},
{
"k": "33775",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}You don't have to worry about the mundies seeing you."
},
{
"k": "33776",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}No… I'm, uh-- some of the animals aren't comfortable around wolves."
},
{
"k": "33777",
"who": "KIDTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}Have you been there before?"
},
{
"k": "33778",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{HappyA}Yeah."
},
{
"k": "33779",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}It'll be nice."
},
{
"k": "33780",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}There's plenty of space to run around, and a nice river nearby so you can swim all you want."
},
{
"k": "33781",
"who": "KIDTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}Even in daytime?"
},
{
"k": "33782",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[bitter]{AnnoyedA}So you wouldn't know, would you?"
},
{
"k": "33783",
"who": "FLYCATCHER",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}We're all set."
},
{
"k": "33784",
"who": "KIDTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{SadA}Bye, Mr. Wolf."
},
{
"k": "33785",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}Goodbye, TJ."
},
{
"k": "33786",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}Where's your friend, Colin?"
},
{
"k": "33787",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[bitter]{NormalA}Hey, Bigby!"
},
{
"k": "33788",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "You still mad?"
},
{
"k": "33789",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "Sorry, Colin."
},
{
"k": "33790",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "I wish I could visit."
},
{
"k": "33791",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}Maybe if you do bad enough here they'll ban you from Fabletown too. Then we can go on the run together."
},
{
"k": "33792",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{WorriedA}I... wish I could come visit you. {NormalA}Up at the Farm."
},
{
"k": "33793",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[bitter]{AnnoyedA}Yeah, well… too bad everyone up there hates you."
},
{
"k": "33794",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[laughs]{HappyA}Yeah… maybe."
},
{
"k": "33795",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}You can show me around the Carpathians or somethin'."
},
{
"k": "33796",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[still bitter]{NormalA}Look, I know why you had to send me away. Snow's Deputy Mayor now… officially. So I get it."
},
{
"k": "33797",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[pushing your buttons]Gotta stay on good terms with the boss lady, right?"
},
{
"k": "33798",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}I guess I'll see you around..."
},
{
"k": "33799",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}I can't make any promises."
},
{
"k": "33800",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}I'll try."
},
{
"k": "33801",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}Yeah... see you around."
},
{
"k": "33802",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "Snow made the call."
},
{
"k": "33803",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}It was Snow's call to make. She's in charge now..."
},
{
"k": "33804",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}It's my job, Colin."
},
{
"k": "33805",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "Snow's in charge now."
},
{
"k": "33806",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "And that means no one gets special treatment."
},
{
"k": "33807",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}Stay outta trouble, okay."
},
{
"k": "33808",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}They're ready to go back there."
},
{
"k": "33809",
"who": "FLYCATCHER",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{HappyA}Great."
},
{
"k": "33810",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[process - across the street]{NormalA}Saying goodbye?"
},
{
"k": "33811",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "What about?"
},
{
"k": "33812",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "All right. Thanks."
},
{
"k": "33813",
"who": "FLYCATCHER",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "Uh… I don't know. She just said she wanted to talk to you."
},
{
"k": "33814",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "I thought I could leave town and forget it, but… if I'm going to start over I need someone to know the truth."
},
{
"k": "33815",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "And now that I can talk… there's something I needed to tell you."
},
{
"k": "33816",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "I wanted to thank you."
},
{
"k": "33817",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "How are things?"
},
{
"k": "33818",
"who": "KIDTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[near tears]{SadA}Please."
},
{
"k": "33819",
"who": "KIDTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{SadA}I wanna stay here."
},
{
"k": "33820",
"who": "KIDTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[sniffles]{SadA}"
},
{
"k": "33821",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "Must be missing."
},
{
"k": "33822",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "How should I know."
},
{
"k": "33823",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "He gets to stay."
},
{
"k": "33824",
"who": "FLYCATCHER",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "But Snow said he was supposed to be on the truck."
},
{
"k": "33825",
"who": "FLYCATCHER",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "I couldn't find him..."
},
{
"k": "33826",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{AngryA}Where's the fuckin' pig?"
},
{
"k": "33827",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{AnnoyedA}Bull. Shit."
},
{
"k": "33828",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}I don't know... he must've run off."
},
{
"k": "33829",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}How should I know?"
},
{
"k": "33830",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}Colin gets to stay."
},
{
"k": "33831",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{AngryA}That's bullshit, Bigby! And you know it!"
},
{
"k": "33832",
"who": "FLYCATCHER",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "That's not what Snow said..."
},
{
"k": "33833",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[muttering]{AnnoyedA}You're all fuckin' corrupt."
},
{
"k": "33834",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[muttering]{AnnoyedA}Right. That's what I thought."
},
{
"k": "33835",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "So... how are things? Now that Georgie-"
},
{
"k": "33836",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{HappyA}Hi."
},
{
"k": "33837",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "They're... different."
},
{
"k": "33838",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "Still getting used it it... you know."
},
{
"k": "33839",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}Listen, I... I came here because... {SadA}I have to tell you something."
},
{
"k": "33840",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "There's something I need to tell you."
},
{
"k": "33841",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[tense; holding back emotion]{SadA}I-- I left Faith's head at your doorstep."
},
{
"k": "33842",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "So that blood on the fence..."
},
{
"k": "33843",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "So that piece of fabric..."
},
{
"k": "33844",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "How did you..."
},
{
"k": "33845",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "You really freaked us out."
},
{
"k": "33846",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "The ring in her mouth..."
},
{
"k": "33847",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "You? Why would you…"
},
{
"k": "33848",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}People like us get forgotten all the time."
},
{
"k": "33849",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "I just... had to tell someone."
},
{
"k": "33850",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[sad joke]Ruined a perfectly good pair of pants."
},
{
"k": "33851",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}Yeah…"
},
{
"k": "33852",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{ThinkingA}So that blood I found… that was you?"
},
{
"k": "33853",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{ThinkingA}So that piece of fabric I found near there… that was you?"
},
{
"k": "33854",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}I cut my leg trying to get over the fence."
},
{
"k": "33855",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{ThinkingA}So that ring in her mouth... that was you?"
},
{
"k": "33856",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "It wasn't easy. I had to hop over the fence around back."
},
{
"k": "33857",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "Cut my leg open pretty bad."
},
{
"k": "33858",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "And the ring in her mouth..."
},
{
"k": "33859",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "Did it help?"
},
{
"k": "33860",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "I needed you to know what happened."
},
{
"k": "33861",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "Our lives and our deaths just… go unnoticed."
},
{
"k": "33862",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}When we suffer, we do it in silence. [beat] And the world likes it that way."
},
{
"k": "33863",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}Or Lily."
},
{
"k": "33864",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "What about Lily?"
},
{
"k": "33865",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}People aren't in a habit of stopping by the Pudding 'N Pie to check on things."
},
{
"k": "33866",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}Nobody cares about us."
},
{
"k": "33867",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}Not really."
},
{
"k": "33868",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "I'm sorry you had to do that."
},
{
"k": "33869",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "That won't happen anymore."
},
{
"k": "33870",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{WorriedA}I'm sorry, Nerissa."
},
{
"k": "33871",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}I'm sorry that's what it took to get me to pay attention."
},
{
"k": "33872",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "[trying to sound hopeful]{NormalA}It'll be different now."
},
{
"k": "33873",
"who": "NERISSA",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_woodlandstreet",
"en": "{NormalA}You'll make things right… you and Snow."
}
]